SPECIAL ISSUE ARTICLE
Working well with statisticians: Perceptions of practicing
statisticians on their most successful collaborations
Ryan A. Peterson 1 | Emily Slade 2 | Gina-Maria Pomann 3 |
Walter T. Ambrosius 4
1Department of Biostatistics & Informatics, University of Colorado-Anschutz Medical Campus, Aurora, Colorado, USA
2Department of Biostatistics, University of Kentucky, Lexington, Kentucky, USA
3Department of Biostatistics and Bioinformatics, School of Medicine, Duke University, Durham, North Carolina, USA
